e salt brokers (Hausa: fatoma) with the ability to guarantee short term credit in the transactions which they managed. In some instances, too, the firms extended goods on credit to distributors who sold salt in the streets and villages.” '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 862, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 774})
